== INVITATION <invitation>

The Board of OtaNix ry invites you to the statutory meeting of the association.

The Annual General Meeting will be held at Tietotekniikan talo (Konemiehentie 2, Espoo) on 2026-02-23 at 16:00.

The agenda of the meeting is as follows:

+ Opening of the meeting
+ Legality and quorum of the meeting
+ Election of meeting officials
  - Chairperson
  - Secretary
  - Examiners of the minutes and vote counters
+ Approval of the agenda
+ Presentation of the financial statement and annual report for 2024
+ Statement of the operations inspectors for 2024
+ Confirmation of the financial statement and granting discharge from liability to the Board and other accountable persons for 2024
+ Presentation of the financial statement and annual report for 2025
+ Statement of the operations inspectors for 2025
+ Confirmation of the financial statement and granting discharge from liability to the Board and other accountable persons for 2025
+ Deciding on the membership fee for 2026
  - Board's proposal: 0 €
+ Presentation of the action plan and budget for 2026
+ Confirmation of the action plan and budget
+ Election of the Board for 2026
  - Size and roles of the Board (proposal: Chairperson, Vice Chairperson, Secretary, Treasurer)
  - Election of persons
+ Election of operations inspectors
+ Closing of the meeting

We ask you to sign up using #link("https://nextcloud.otanix.fi/apps/forms/s/XadSqoGBgEZAefHxocsStmGi")[this form].
